{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":2787,"name":"Toufeeq  Pasha","username":"Toufeeq_Pasha","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.availproject.org/toufeeq_pasha/{size}/858_2.png","created_at":"2025-02-15T13:08:08.881Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReport Author:\u003c/strong\u003e Toufeeq\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eExecution Details:\u003c/strong\u003e Changes will be applied at block \u003cspan class=\"hashtag-raw\"\u003e#989\u003c/span\u003e,865\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTechnical Committee Consensus:\u003c/strong\u003e 5/7 signers \u003ca href=\"https://avail.subscan.io/tech/27?tab=proposal\" class=\"inline-onebox\"\u003eSubscan | Aggregate Substrate ecological network high-precision Web3 explorer\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-2787-introduction-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-2787-introduction-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIntroduction\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis document provides transparency on upcoming or executed network changes. The Technical Committee (TC) has approved increasing the \u003cstrong\u003eblock size from 2MB to 4MB\u003c/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003emaximum DA transaction size from 0.5MB to 1MB\u003c/strong\u003e to meet the growing demand for larger data submissions and optimize blockspace. After assessing their \u003cstrong\u003eeffectiveness, impact, execution feasibility, and security implications\u003c/strong\u003e, the TC reached a \u003cstrong\u003e5/7 majority consensus\u003c/strong\u003e to proceed with the upgrade.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-2787-proposed-executed-changes-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-2787-proposed-executed-changes-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProposed / Executed Changes\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe proposal was discussed in \u003ca href=\"https://forum.availproject.org/t/aip-6-increase-block-size-to-4mb-maxappdatalength-to-1-mb/1648\"\u003eAIP 6\u003c/a\u003e, introduces two key changes:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBlock size increase from \u003cstrong\u003e2MB\u003c/strong\u003e to \u003cstrong\u003e4MB\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMax DA transaction size (MaxAppDataLength) increase from \u003cstrong\u003e512KB\u003c/strong\u003e to \u003cstrong\u003e1MB\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-2787-code-modifications-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-2787-code-modifications-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCode Modifications\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor those interested, you can review the necessary code modifications in the following PRs:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://github.com/availproject/avail/pull/717\"\u003ePR\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-2787-potential-merits-to-the-network-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-2787-potential-merits-to-the-network-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePotential Merits to the Network\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncreased scalability:\u003c/strong\u003e Supports higher data throughput without degrading network performance.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eImproved efficiency:\u003c/strong\u003e Larger transactions reduce fragmentation and optimize blockspace usage.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSeamless adoption:\u003c/strong\u003e Testing on \u003cstrong\u003eTuring testnet\u003c/strong\u003e confirmed that block propagation and validation remain stable.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFuture-proofing:\u003c/strong\u003e Ensures Avail can handle growing data demands while maintaining decentralization and security.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you need further details or have any concerns, please feel free to leave a comment.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThank you.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":1,"updated_at":"2025-02-15T13:08:08.881Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":315,"reads":16,"readers_count":15,"score":1673.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":1651,"topic_slug":"avail-transparency-report-14-increased-block-size-to-4mb-max-da-tx-size-to-1mb","display_username":"Toufeeq  Pasha","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://avail.subscan.io/tech/27?tab=proposal","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"Subscan | Aggregate Substrate ecological network high-precision Web3 explorer","clicks":7},{"url":"https://forum.availproject.org/t/aip-6-increase-block-size-to-4mb-maxappdatalength-to-1-mb/1648","internal":true,"reflection":false,"title":"AIP 6: Increase Block Size to 4MB \u0026 MaxAppDataLength to 1 MB","clicks":1},{"url":"https://github.com/availproject/avail/pull/717","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"Increased max DA tx size to 1MiB by ToufeeqP · Pull Request #717 · availproject/avail · GitHub","clicks":0}],"read":true,"user_title":"Avail Technical Committee","title_is_group":false,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":5}],"moderator":true,"admin":false,"staff":true,"user_id":999,"hidden":false,"trust_level":1,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/avail-transparency-report-14-increased-block-size-to-4mb-max-da-tx-size-to-1mb/1651/1","reactions":[{"id":"heart","type":"emoji","count":5}],"current_u